cmd-lobbyshowcase-desc = Preview a populated lobby lineup with several factions and squads, locally.
cmd-lobbyshowcase-help = Usage: lobbyshowcase [1-256] [window] [debug] [flyby|parade], or lobbyshowcase off. Defaults to the player UI with 60 sample characters; you control the first character and preview chat stays local. Enable cmu.lobby_party_time for the lineup, cmu.lobby_party_time_flyby for flybys, or cmu.lobby_party_time_parade for parades; each switch works independently. Use flyby or parade to preview that show after arrival, debug to control any sample character and expose demo controls, window for a separate preview, or off to restore live players. Outside the lobby, queues the showcase for your next lobby connection.
